                                "sense_id": "79ff3980-7593-3aee-9351-9a7a4dd9cff6",
                                "text": "Water-purslan, cucumbers, even a drink of water have all been estimated, at various times, to be conducive to anti-aphrodisiac feelings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7515dd3b-63da-42af-b846-2df0f9f89807",
                                "sense_id": "79ff3980-7593-3aee-9351-9a7a4dd9cff6",
                                "text": "The males of other insects try to keep their mates faithful by daubing them with an antiaphrodisiac pheromone, a scent that mixes with the female's own scent and makes her less attractive to other males."
                            }
                        ]
